1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,935
Why are you out here?

2
00:00:03,235 --> 00:00:04,671
You're not coming in?

3
00:00:04,671 --> 00:00:06,639
I will after
I sober up a little.

4
00:00:11,878 --> 00:00:13,613
You still have
the bandages on?

5
00:00:14,047 --> 00:00:15,415
Oh.

6
00:00:15,415 --> 00:00:16,916
When you get older

7
00:00:16,916 --> 00:00:18,151
it takes more time to recover.

8
00:00:18,318 --> 00:00:19,853
- Let me see.
- Ouch!

9
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:21,321
Now you're just exaggerating.

10
00:00:21,321 --> 00:00:22,455
Not at all.

11
00:00:22,756 --> 00:00:24,024
You'll know it
when you get older.

12
00:00:24,024 --> 00:00:25,425
Everything hurts.

13
00:00:38,638 --> 00:00:40,740
So how are things these days?

14
00:00:42,208 --> 00:00:43,209
Same as usual.

15
00:00:43,209 --> 00:00:44,411
I ignore calls.

16
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:48,848
Tell me if you need me.

17
00:00:49,816 --> 00:00:51,317
I'll help with
whatever you need.

18
00:00:51,918 --> 00:00:53,586
- Whatever?
- Whatever.

19
00:00:54,521 --> 00:00:55,722
Then...

20
00:00:55,722 --> 00:00:57,223
Can I get some dating advice?
